EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University.

Students are automatically considered for our New American University Scholarships upon admission (https://students.asu.edu/scholarships). An ACT or SAT score is required for merit-based scholarship consideration. We accept scores listed on your official transcript or sent directly from the testing centers using the ASU school codes 4007 for SAT (http://collegeboard.org) or 0088 for ACT (http://actstudent.org).

Use our scholarship estimator (http://scholarships.asu.edu/estimator) to see if you may be eligible for one of our merit-based scholarships. View more information on scholarships at https://students.asu.edu/scholarships.

We don’t want you to miss out on this scholarship opportunity. Please let me know if you have any further questions. I am happy to assist you.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
